= Findings <sec:findings>

Replace this section with evidence-backed findings. A useful pattern is:

#table(
  columns: (1.1fr, 1.7fr, 1fr),
  align: (left, left, left),
  table.header([Finding], [Evidence], [Confidence]),
  [Replace with a supported finding], [Name the supplied source], [State the justified confidence],
  [Replace with another finding], [Name the supplied source], [State the justified confidence],
)

Explain contradictions and missing inputs alongside the table rather than hiding them in a note.
